city='Mátészalka'
source(city,'Mátészalkai Ipari Park','osm:relation:2558326','Unchanged southern component of the actual industrial landuse relation, containing the industrial-park label and MOM industrial site. This component is physically separate from the northern Nyugati Iparterület component; name association remains approximate.',1)
source(city,'Nyugati Iparterület','osm:relation:2558326','Unchanged northern component of the industrial landuse relation, containing the Nyugati Iparterület label. The spatially separate southern component receives the industrial-park name. These are inferred local names for real mapped industrial surfaces, not aliases of the whole multi-part parent.',0)
